reviews but now everyime I seem to read something about the Riu Its BAD...OMG would love to hear from any past Riu Brides within the last couple of years with their experiences. Thanks :(&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1851700,"PostDate":1400747629,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Our wedding is booked for May 2015 at the Riu Ocho Rios, I done my research before booking and found both bad and good reviews but now everyime I seem to read something about the Riu Its BAD...OMG would love to hear from any past Riu Brides within the last couple of years with their experiences. Thanks <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kay.vaillancourt@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.252.61.182","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1378730769,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-273327.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kay2015","Id":273327,"Name":"kay2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.222.63.146","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77121,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7ea41a19a8f6fe656c8460330b4dab1a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;If you;ve already booked stop reading reviews! I got married in CUba and I had read so many reviews and they were good and then there was this slew of BAD reviews but you know what people always have something to complain about and the people who tend to go on sites often go on because they are upset. I am sure the resort will be wonderful! If there is one thing I would recommend as a past bride don&#039;t worry it was all be wonderful! Our wedding was better then we could have even imagined and I know think WHY did I spend soo much time worrying over nothing!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1851714,"PostDate":1400750043,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>If you;ve already booked stop reading reviews! I got married in CUba and I had read so many reviews and they were good and then there was this slew of BAD reviews but you know what people always have something to complain about and the people who tend to go on sites often go on because they are upset. I am sure the resort will be wonderful! If there is one thing I would recommend as a past bride don't worry it was all be wonderful! Our wedding was better then we could have even imagined and I know think WHY did I spend soo much time worrying over nothing!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Happily Married!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/74669-destination-engagement-photos-dubrovnik-croatia\/?hl=%2Bcroatia+%2Bengagement+%2Bphotos'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/74669-destination-engagement-photos-dubrovnik-croatia\/?hl=%2Bcroatia+%2Bengagement+%2Bphotos<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76346-carinas-csho-iberostar-laguna-azul-planning-journal-050514\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76346-carinas-csho-iberostar-laguna-azul-planning-journal-050514\/<\/a>","Email":"crins_15@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.222.63.146","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1351766568,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-261965.jpg?_r=1400781457","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"csho","Id":261965,"Name":"csho","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.252.61.182","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77121,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"98f12357575efb60f8cb84e099fbdc89","RawContent":"&lt;p style=\"margin-left:40px;\"&gt;Thank you soo much and yes I think its time for me to stop worrying lol just soo hard when I want things to go smooth.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1851847,"PostDate":1400833736,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p  style=\"margin-left:40px\">Thank you soo much and yes I think its time for me to stop worrying lol just soo hard when I want things to go smooth.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kay.vaillancourt@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.252.61.182","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1378730769,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-273327.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kay2015","Id":273327,"Name":"kay2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.222.63.146","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77121,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"71c4939de0cb1d3e93bac3e70d5d419c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"kay2015\"] I know I did too but you decided to have a destination wedding and you can&#039;t control everything so no need to worry it will all go smoothly once you get there and just be open minded and go with the flow and you will have an amazing time!!!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1851851,"PostDate":1400834835,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"273327\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/273327-kay2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">kay2015<\/span><\/a> I know I did too but you decided to have a destination wedding and you can't control everything so no need to worry it will all go smoothly once you get there and just be open minded and go with the flow and you will have an amazing time!!!!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Happily Married!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/74669-destination-engagement-photos-dubrovnik-croatia\/?hl=%2Bcroatia+%2Bengagement+%2Bphotos'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/74669-destination-engagement-photos-dubrovnik-croatia\/?hl=%2Bcroatia+%2Bengagement+%2Bphotos<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76346-carinas-csho-iberostar-laguna-azul-planning-journal-050514\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76346-carinas-csho-iberostar-laguna-azul-planning-journal-050514\/<\/a>","Email":"crins_15@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.222.63.146","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1351766568,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-261965.jpg?_r=1400781457","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"csho","Id":261965,"Name":"csho","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.252.61.182","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77121,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6a585890bb439ffd9e86189ec69e57a2","RawContent":"[quote name=\"csho\" post=\"1851851\" timestamp=\"1400849235\"]\n@[member=\"kay2015\"] I know I did too but you decided to have a destination wedding and you can&#039;t control everything so no need to worry it will all go smoothly once you get there and just be open minded and go with the flow and you will have an amazing time!!!!![\/quote]I just seen that you got married like 2 weeks ago congrats...I been to that resort for my Brother in law wedding in 2010 it was beautiful then I know you guys had a ball.","Attachments":[],"Id":1851871,"PostDate":1400839894,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>csho, on 23 May 2014 - 08:47 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"273327\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/273327-kay2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">kay2015<\/span><\/a> I know I did too but you decided to have a destination wedding and you can't control everything so no need to worry it will all go smoothly once you get there and just be open minded and go with the flow and you will have an amazing time!!!!!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>I just seen that you got married like 2 weeks ago congrats...I been to that resort for my Brother in law wedding in 2010 it was beautiful then I know you guys had a ball.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kay.vaillancourt@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.252.61.182","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1378730769,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-273327.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kay2015","Id":273327,"Name":"kay2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.64.166.74","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77121,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"60ced0bfedf7e15143226f8c78a6276a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"csho\"] hope you had a beautiful wedding! I&#039;m so guilty of looking at TripAdvisor reviews. I can&#039;t stop! I literally check the website about three times a day. Thankfully most of them have been positive so it&#039;s not making me crazy yet :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1851915,"PostDate":1400863996,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"261965\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/261965-csho\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">csho<\/span><\/a> hope you had a beautiful wedding! I'm so guilty of looking at TripAdvisor reviews. I can't stop! I literally check the website about three times a day. Thankfully most of them have been positive so it's not making me crazy yet <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tebbswedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"137.186.146.109","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1391033009,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276400.jpg?_r=1396405141","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LissaSou","Id":276400,"Name":"LissaSou","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.115.48.118","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77121,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e88a1bdaa6d4eddbc1f80be5b45c588b","RawContent":"I did too! But honestly it was a waste of time! I can&#039;t even believe what some people complained of. We had the most wonderful time!","Attachments":[],"Id":1851944,"PostDate":1400879648,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I did too! But honestly it was a waste of time! I can't even believe what some people complained of. We had the most wonderful time! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Happily Married!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/74669-destination-engagement-photos-dubrovnik-croatia\/?hl=%2Bcroatia+%2Bengagement+%2Bphotos'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/74669-destination-engagement-photos-dubrovnik-croatia\/?hl=%2Bcroatia+%2Bengagement+%2Bphotos<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76346-carinas-csho-iberostar-laguna-azul-planning-journal-050514\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76346-carinas-csho-iberostar-laguna-azul-planning-journal-050514\/<\/a>","Email":"crins_15@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.222.63.146","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1351766568,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-261965.jpg?_r=1400781457","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"csho","Id":261965,"Name":"csho","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"199.202.144.192","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77121,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1f5fa1b45cc9e09c42b7e259903d5ed4","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I have been noticing the same thinng&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I have been relying on the reviews on here though from past brides... fingers crossed no issues!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1852887,"PostDate":1401473647,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I have been noticing the same thinng<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I have been relying on the reviews on here though from past brides... fingers crossed no issues!!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jlynnmape@gmail.com","IpAddress":"199.202.144.192","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1389380770,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"jayejayelynn","Id":275997,"Name":"jayejayelynn","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.40.73","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77121,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f9f8a216683056c638243ec40c6fb141","RawContent":"I always read what the bad things are that ppl say - most are petty complaints I find. If I see a whack of \"we all got good poisoning, had bed bugs, got stolen from etc.\" then I worry. Otherwise, ppl love to compain!\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1852939,"PostDate":1401490956,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I always read what the bad things are that ppl say - most are petty complaints I find. If I see a whack of \"we all got good poisoning, had bed bugs, got stolen from etc.\" then I worry. Otherwise, ppl love to compain!<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"chelseapjohnson@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"70.72.57.238","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1361480068,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266402.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"chelseapaige37","Id":266402,"Name":"chelseapaige37","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.252.61.182","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77121,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3ea496d3129d984d7ebc44fec55adee0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Im trying ladies I am to stay off trip adviser ol....one the plus said we are already booked so what will be will be and im sure everything will work out and what doesnt we deal with it right? and im sure everything will be just fine.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1853772,"PostDate":1401871017,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Im trying ladies I am to stay off trip adviser ol....one the plus said we are already booked so what will be will be and im sure everything will work out and what doesnt we deal with it right? and im sure everything will be just fine.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kay.vaillancourt@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.252.61.182","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1378730769,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-273327.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kay2015","Id":273327,"Name":"kay2015","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"77121","Title":"Bad Reviews!","LastPostDate":1401871017},"Pages":{"TotalItems":10,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Valu