Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":7,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":true,"Views":157,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1914235,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":281493,"Name":"caity59","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281493.jpg?_r=1461262721","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1465308269,"LastPoster":{"Id":287113,"Name":"DreamArtPhotography","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287113.jpg?_r=1465693518","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":2,"Preview":{"Id":1914235,"PostDate":1465308269,"PostContent":"Hey !! \u00a0 Been following this website since getting engaged 2 years ago and finally getting somewh...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"caitylebel.59@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"67.204.239.218","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1419697905,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281493.jpg?_r=1461262721","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"caity59","Id":281493,"Name":"caity59","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"209.91.136.186","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80126,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"17dbf39b53c381a154a573c77d8e3eb5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hey !!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Been following this website since getting engaged 2 years ago and finally getting somewhere with our wedding planning!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;\nI have always wanted to get married on the beach and since Cancun is one of our favorite places to go we can&#039;t wait for all of our family to be there!\n\n\nSo far our list is about 75 people but I think close to 50 guest will join!\n\n\nWe finally found Blue Venado and we think it will be great for our budget!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Any past\/future brides have any must haves or any helpful ideas to planning would be awesome&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;So excited for it to all come together even it is in 2 years :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914235,"PostDate":1465308269,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hey !!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Been following this website since getting engaged 2 years ago and finally getting somewhere with our wedding planning!<\/p>\n<p>\nI have always wanted to get married on the beach and since Cancun is one of our favorite places to go we can't wait for all of our family to be there!<br><br>\nSo far our list is about 75 people but I think close to 50 guest will join!<br><br>\nWe finally found Blue Venado and we think it will be great for our budget!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Any past\/future brides have any must haves or any helpful ideas to planning would be awesome<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>So excited for it to all come together even it is in 2 years <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"caitylebel.59@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"67.204.239.218","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1419697905,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281493.jpg?_r=1461262721","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"caity59","Id":281493,"Name":"caity59","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"189.221.42.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80126,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by StylingTrioRivieraMaya, 07 June 2016 - 07:26 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1465327574,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e7da95fa06ec51c02beb8e6d1875e3a1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"caity59\"] Welcome and CONGRATS on your upcoming wedding AND &amp;nbsp;your wedding planning! We at Styling Trio, LOVE Blue Venado, it&#039;s a wonderful place and gorgeous for a wedding. We are close with one of the Managers there, his name is Tonio, so if there is anything you need, please don&#039;t hesitate to ask. Also, we have good relationships with photographers in the area as we work with many when doing hair and makeup (our specialty).&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;So for now, I&#039;ll leave you to your planning...even if it is in 2 years. :) And I&#039;ll also leave you with a helpful tidbit about getting \"dolled\" up in tropical climates like in the Riviera Maya Mexico! Check it out at your leisure, it&#039;s a great read from someone on our team. Here&#039;s the link:&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/wedding-tips\/c\/planning\/q-a-is-airbrush-makeup-ideal-in-a-tropic-r2326&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/wedding-tips\/c\/planning\/q-a-is-airbrush-makeup-ideal-in-a-tropic-r2326&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Happy Planning!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914250,"PostDate":1465327520,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281493\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281493-caity59\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">caity59<\/span><\/a> Welcome and CONGRATS on your upcoming wedding AND \u00a0your wedding planning! We at Styling Trio, LOVE Blue Venado, it's a wonderful place and gorgeous for a wedding. We are close with one of the Managers there, his name is Tonio, so if there is anything you need, please don't hesitate to ask. Also, we have good relationships with photographers in the area as we work with many when doing hair and makeup (our specialty).\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>So for now, I'll leave you to your planning...even if it is in 2 years. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> And I'll also leave you with a helpful tidbit about getting \"dolled\" up in tropical climates like in the Riviera Maya Mexico! Check it out at your leisure, it's a great read from someone on our team. Here's the link:\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/wedding-tips\/c\/planning\/q-a-is-airbrush-makeup-ideal-in-a-tropic-r2326' class='bbc_url' title=''>http:\/\/www.bestdesti...-a-tropic-r2326<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy Planning!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(90,90,90);\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-family:'lucida sans unicode', 'lucida grande', sans-serif;\">Dena DaSilva<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(90,90,90);\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-family:'lucida sans unicode', 'lucida grande', sans-serif;\">Online Concierge<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(90,90,90);\"><span style=\"color:#ff99cc;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-family:'lucida sans unicode', 'lucida grande', sans-serif;\">US (+1) 713 589 4558<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family:'lucida sans unicode', 'lucida grande', sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(90,90,90);\"><span style=\"color:#ff99cc;\">MX (+52) 984 803 2816<br>\nconcierge@stylingtrio.com<\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#ff99cc;\">www.stylingtrio.com<\/span><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(105,105,105);\">Facebook: <\/span><span style=\"color:#ff99cc;\">facebook\/stylingtrio.com<\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(105,105,105);\">Twitter:<\/span><span style=\"color:rgb(238,130,238);\">\u00a0<\/span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,153,204);\">@stylingtrio<\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(105,105,105);\">Instagram:<\/span><span style=\"color:rgb(238,130,238);\">\u00a0<\/span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,153,204);\">@stylingtrio<\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(105,105,105);\">Pinterest: <\/span><span style=\"color:#ff99cc;\">www.pinterest.com\/stylingtrio<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(90,90,90);\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(90,90,90);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:'Helvetica Neue', Arial, Verdana, sans-serif;\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(90,90,90);\"><img src=\"https:\/\/ci4.googleusercontent.com\/proxy\/hapv1CMGpXYv2FEz6ZYtPWd2Y_yEKx8fi8QHoF6qa6giBtQe5Sq7Qu37JOO6-9XwSHFc1cI6Ke5Y2N3x9Ue9=s0-d-e1-ft#http:\/\/stylingtrio.com\/Firmas\/Styling.jpg\" alt=\"Styling.jpg\"><\/p>\n<p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(90,90,90);\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(90,90,90);\">\u00a0","Email":"social@stylingtrio.com","IpAddress":"189.221.40.208","GroupId":84,"GroupName":"Insiders w\/ Articles","JoinDate":1462465132,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-286883.jpg?_r=1463007029","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"StylingTrioRivieraMaya","Id":286883,"Name":"StylingTrioRivieraMaya","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"189.221.38.183","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80126,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"394344d2735744d40994492649fdc56d","RawContent":"[quote name=\"caity59\" post=\"1914235\" timestamp=\"1465322669\"]\nHey !!\n\nBeen following this website since getting engaged 2 years ago and finally getting somewhere with our wedding planning!\nI have always wanted to get married on the beach and since Cancun is one of our favorite places to go we can&#039;t wait for all of our family to be there!\n\nSo far our list is about 75 people but I think close to 50 guest will join!\n\nWe finally found Blue Venado and we think it will be great for our budget!\n\nAny past\/future brides have any must haves or any helpful ideas to planning would be awesome\n\n\nSo excited for it to all come together even it is in 2 years :)[\/quote][quote name=\"caity59\" post=\"1914235\" timestamp=\"1465322669\"]\nHey !!\n\nBeen following this website since getting engaged 2 years ago and finally getting somewhere with our wedding planning!\nI have always wanted to get married on the beach and since Cancun is one of our favorite places to go we can&#039;t wait for all of our family to be there!\n\nSo far our list is about 75 people but I think close to 50 guest will join!\n\nWe finally found Blue Venado and we think it will be great for our budget!\n\nAny past\/future brides have any must haves or any helpful ideas to planning would be awesome\n\n\nSo excited for it to all come together even it is in 2 years :)[\/quote]@[member=\"caity59\"] congrats on finding your location.  such excited times ahead.    Well I have few weddings in 2017 at BV and already has brides get married here. if you put in the search box blue venado brides, there should be a thread pop up.  \n\nlove the privacy and the rustic feel to the location. hmmm have you done any menu tasting yet? did I mention your wedding can go up to 4am if you choose. Take a look at the packages they offer most of them include most things.\n\neverything is in the sand advice your guests its going to be a barefoot wedding, or if budget allows maybe get the flipflops to dance the night away.\n\n Feel free to ask away if any doesn&#039;t make sense.\nHappy Planning","Attachments":[],"Id":1914266,"PostDate":1465390698,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>caity59, on 07 June 2016 - 02:04 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hey !!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Been following this website since getting engaged 2 years ago and finally getting somewhere with our wedding planning!<\/p>\n<p>I have always wanted to get married on the beach and since Cancun is one of our favorite places to go we can't wait for all of our family to be there!<br><br>\nSo far our list is about 75 people but I think close to 50 guest will join!<br><br>\nWe finally found Blue Venado and we think it will be great for our budget!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Any past\/future brides have any must haves or any helpful ideas to planning would be awesome<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>So excited for it to all come together even it is in 2 years <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>caity59, on 07 June 2016 - 02:04 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hey !!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Been following this website since getting engaged 2 years ago and finally getting somewhere with our wedding planning!<\/p>\n<p>I have always wanted to get married on the beach and since Cancun is one of our favorite places to go we can't wait for all of our family to be there!<br><br>\nSo far our list is about 75 people but I think close to 50 guest will join!<br><br>\nWe finally found Blue Venado and we think it will be great for our budget!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Any past\/future brides have any must haves or any helpful ideas to planning would be awesome<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>So excited for it to all come together even it is in 2 years <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281493\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281493-caity59\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">caity59<\/span><\/a> congrats on finding your location. \u00a0such excited times ahead. \u00a0 \u00a0Well I have few weddings in 2017 at BV and already has brides get married here. if you put in the search box blue venado brides, there should be a thread pop up. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>love the privacy and the rustic feel to the location. hmmm have you done any menu tasting yet? did I mention your wedding can go up to 4am if you choose. Take a look at the packages they offer most of them include most things.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>everything is in the sand advice your guests its going to be a barefoot wedding, or if budget allows maybe get the flipflops to dance the night away.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0Feel free to ask away if any doesn't make sense.<\/p>\n<p>Happy Planning<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Dream Weddings Riviera Maya- We pay attention to your wishes and coordinate closely with you to ensure your wedding or event is planned to perfection! Supporting you brides and help you feel less overwhelmed during the wedding planning process.<\/p>\n<p>Have fun the best is yet to come!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This is where I will be posting all videos about most common question about Destination wedding<\/p>\n<p> <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Dream Weddings Riviera Maya<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com<\/span><\/span><br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html\">http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Happy Planning!<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Joyce<\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"187.252.44.28","GroupId":84,"GroupName":"Insiders w\/ Articles","JoinDate":1326839987,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250090.jpg?_r=1451923195","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dreamweddings","Id":250090,"Name":"dreamweddings","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.66.4.22","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80126,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by Moments That Matter, 09 June 2016 - 04:35 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1465490135,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"920f38a663aec66f37a4db37a27b99c9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to our forum community caity59, Congrats on your engagement 2 yrs ago, and upcoming destination wedding - WOW!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Selecting your venue is a Big piece of your planning process completed - so well done! Here&#039;s a link to some &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?s=9bdb0dfd90aa26aa6700df60fa941e4c&amp;amp;app=googlecse#gsc.tab=0&amp;amp;gsc.q=Blue%20Venado&#039;&gt;Blue Venado threads on BDW&lt;\/a&gt; ~ in case you haven&#039;t already seen them :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We captured an amazing wedding at the Blue Venado private beach club which culminated in some turtles hatching on the beach right there - so fascinating, and what a wonderful reminder of New Beginnings all around.....as the hatchlings made their way to the ocean for their first swim - Awesome!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;You can see what I&#039;m talking about in this &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/#!riviera-maya-resorts\/lwgjq\/tag\/Blue-Venado-Beach-Club-Wedding&#039;&gt;Blue Venado Wedding Story Album&lt;\/a&gt; (with an excerpt below) - Enjoy!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_d090814984bc4da8bdb7bd2d2034081d.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_d090814984bc4da8bdb7bd2d2034081d.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_d090814984bc4da8bdb7bd2d2034081d.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_a7de4c62a40549c09167c249d2d8276c.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_a7de4c62a40549c09167c249d2d8276c.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_a7de4c62a40549c09167c249d2d8276c.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_3f1e6e3812f345d693b81bfe2e46da12.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_3f1e6e3812f345d693b81bfe2e46da12.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_3f1e6e3812f345d693b81bfe2e46da12.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Even more amazing than doing a butterfly release ceremony!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you happy research, and all the best with your plans - cheers!!! Moments That Matter Photography team :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914299,"PostDate":1465488748,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to our forum community caity59, Congrats on your engagement 2 yrs ago, and upcoming destination wedding - WOW!<\/p>\n<p>Selecting your venue is a Big piece of your planning process completed - so well done! Here's a link to some <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?s=9bdb0dfd90aa26aa6700df60fa941e4c&app=googlecse#gsc.tab=0&gsc.q=Blue%20Venado' class='bbc_url' title=''>Blue Venado threads on BDW<\/a> ~ in case you haven't already seen them <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We captured an amazing wedding at the Blue Venado private beach club which culminated in some turtles hatching on the beach right there - so fascinating, and what a wonderful reminder of New Beginnings all around.....as the hatchlings made their way to the ocean for their first swim - Awesome!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You can see what I'm talking about in this <a href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/#!riviera-maya-resorts\/lwgjq\/tag\/Blue-Venado-Beach-Club-Wedding' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Blue Venado Wedding Story Album<\/a> (with an excerpt below) - Enjoy!!!<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_d090814984bc4da8bdb7bd2d2034081d.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_d090814984bc4da8bdb7bd2d2034081d.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_d090814984bc4da8bdb7bd2d2034081d.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_a7de4c62a40549c09167c249d2d8276c.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_a7de4c62a40549c09167c249d2d8276c.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_a7de4c62a40549c09167c249d2d8276c.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_3f1e6e3812f345d693b81bfe2e46da12.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_3f1e6e3812f345d693b81bfe2e46da12.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_3f1e6e3812f345d693b81bfe2e46da12.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Even more amazing than doing a butterfly release ceremony!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you happy research, and all the best with your plans - cheers!!! Moments That Matter Photography team <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i1378.photobucket.com\/albums\/ah106\/ContactIDoMexico\/MTM%20Logo%202016_zps4tzm05my.png\" alt=\"MTM%20Logo%202016_zps4tzm05my.png\"><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography , Cancun, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving the Riviera Maya<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Email: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><strong>Why we're Ranked #1<\/strong><\/span> ~ Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21512-moments-that-matter-photography\/'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">We Offer<\/span><\/span><\/strong>: <strong><em><u>100% Vendor Fee Discount<\/u><br>\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <u>100% Deposit Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong><em>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 <u>100% Satisfaction Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280196260,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"158.106.64.94","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80126,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9f2f3f2d5a27d89e9c062ebb5026ce05","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"caity59\"] Congrats and welcome!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;There was an Alberta bride that got married I think at Blue Venado last year. I&#039;ll see if I can find her thread. I know Joyce at Dream Weddings helped her with it. It&#039;s a great location. I really liked it when I heard about it but I was set against sand! lol I wanted to wear heels (yes, shoe slut) so sand didn&#039;t work with shoes.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914302,"PostDate":1465489005,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281493\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281493-caity59\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">caity59<\/span><\/a> Congrats and welcome!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>There was an Alberta bride that got married I think at Blue Venado last year. I'll see if I can find her thread. I know Joyce at Dream Weddings helped her with it. It's a great location. I really liked it when I heard about it but I was set against sand! lol I wanted to wear heels (yes, shoe slut) so sand didn't work with shoes.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>I said \"yes\" again to the love of my life at Grand Coral Beach Club, Playa del Carmen, Mexico on our 4th anniversary - October 20, 2015<\/em><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/'><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/<\/em><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"142.241.240.68","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80126,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1d528c4fecd47b27bcfe0b90d3f4278b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"caity59\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Hi there!&amp;nbsp; I just got married there last March and it was awesome,&amp;nbsp; I have left a review under the venue section and I am here for any questions you may have!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Jazmin&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914309,"PostDate":1465559190,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281493\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281493-caity59\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">caity59<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hi there!\u00a0 I just got married there last March and it was awesome,\u00a0 I have left a review under the venue section and I am here for any questions you may have!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Jazmin<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jsalazarmtz@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.239.125.187","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1433684301,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283425.jpg?_r=1458157921","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":188,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jsalazarmtz","Id":283425,"Name":"jsalazarmtz","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"189.221.43.89","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80126,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b4de590aaf5cc6e5870a758dddf7278a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello Caity:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Welcome &amp;amp; congratulations, feel free to visit us and check our Photography Style.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/287113-dreamartphotography&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/287113-dreamartphotography&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[{"Id":35953,"Name":"WPP041516NA1 - 756.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287113-0-70658400-1465596663.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287113-0-70658400-1465596663_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":668}],"Id":1914316,"PostDate":1465582271,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello Caity:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Welcome & congratulations, feel free to visit us and check our Photography Style.<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/287113-dreamartphotography' class='bbc_url' title=''>http:\/\/www.bestdesti...martphotography<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span>Saludos<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span><b>Virginia Hermosillo<\/b><\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Dream Art \u00a0Wedding Photography<\/b><\/p>\n<p><span><span>contact<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:vhermosillo@dreamartphotography.com'>@dreamartphotography.com<\/a><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span>Tel: +(52) 998 246-5657<\/span><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/weddings.dreamartphotography.com'>http:\/\/weddings.dreamartphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><img src=\"http:\/\/weddings.dreamartphotography.com\/images\/wedding-logo-moto.png\" alt=\"wedding-logo-moto.png\"><\/p>\n<p><span>\u00a0<\/span>","Email":"contact@dreamartphotography.com","IpAddress":"189.221.43.89","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1465480401,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287113.jpg?_r=1465693518","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"DreamArtPhotography","Id":287113,"Name":"DreamArtPhotography","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"80126","Title":"Blue Venado Brides!","LastPostDate":1465582271},"Pages":{"TotalItems":7,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
